* How Pendle V2 works
** SY wrapper
*** exchangeRate = asset per SY
*** narrow token-out set
*** pausable, upgradeable
** PT + YT split
*** mintPY: SY x pyIndex PT and YT
*** pyIndex never decreases
*** YT accrues interest in SY
*** post-expiry yield to treasury
** Market AMM (PT / SY)
*** logit curve, rateScalar = scalarRoot / tau
*** rateAnchor re-solved each trade
*** ln implied rate stored
*** fee on the rate, reserve share
*** 96 % PT cap, rate >= 0
** PT price
*** e^(-r tau) without trades
*** 1 asset at expiry if SY solvent
*** no AMM after expiry
left side
** Oracles
*** TWAP of ln implied rate
*** cardinality, 900-1800 s windows
*** linear discount 1 - d tau
*** price to SY, not asset
** Router V4
*** zaps, binary search, aggregator
*** YT via flash swaps
** PT as collateral
*** Morpho Blue base feed
*** pool depth, out of range
*** oracle choice, SY depeg
*** pause and upgrade keys
@endmindmap
